1
00:00:00,768 --> 00:00:03,188
- It was?
- Oh, yeah, going slow really worked.

2
00:00:03,688 --> 00:00:05,318
(Leonard:)You're kidding.

3
00:00:05,815 --> 00:00:07,855
(Leonard:)Never worked for me.

4
00:00:08,026 --> 00:00:10,356
(Stuart:)Yeah, last night at dinner
I did what you told me.

5
00:00:10,528 --> 00:00:13,318
(Stuart:)I went really slow, I kept my distance...

6
00:00:13,489 --> 00:00:15,489
(Stuart:)...and two bottles of wine later,
we were making out.

7
00:00:16,492 --> 00:00:20,042
(Leonard:)Wine? I didn't say to give her wine.

8
00:00:20,580 --> 00:00:23,000
(Stuart:)It doesn't matter.
That's where it all went to hell.

9
00:00:23,166 --> 00:00:24,416
(Leonard:)During the kissing?

10
00:00:24,584 --> 00:00:28,504
(Leonard:)What did you do, sneeze in her mouth?
I did that to a girl once.

11
00:00:29,756 --> 00:00:32,676
(Stuart:)No, everything was good and really hot.

12
00:00:32,842 --> 00:00:35,802
And I said, "Oh, Penny"...

13
00:00:35,970 --> 00:00:39,430
(Stuart:)...and right where she was supposed
to say, "Oh, Stuart" she said...

14
00:00:40,725 --> 00:00:42,435
(Stuart:)...your name.

15
00:00:47,231 --> 00:00:48,981
- Leonard?
- That is your name, right?

16
00:00:49,150 --> 00:00:51,530
Yeah. No, yeah, it is.

17
00:00:51,694 --> 00:00:53,274
(Leonard:)Wow, I'm sorry.

18
00:00:53,446 --> 00:00:55,866
(Leonard:)That must've been the last thing
you wanted to hear.

19
00:00:56,032 --> 00:01:02,022
(Stuart:)Well, it beats,
"You know I'm a dude, right?"

